    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41579" root="وتب" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَبَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتِبُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتْبٌ</span>, <i>He remained
fixed in the place, and did not move.</i> (K.)
Omitted by most of the lexicographers; and
said by some to be a word mispronounced [app.
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثَبَ</span>]. (TA.)

